    "detailed_description": "Cosmic Outpost is a turn-based strategy game where you build an outpost on a new planet. As pioneers, you will construct an outpost while defending against enemies. Gather enough materials to build a spaceship to explore new worlds and expand humanity's frontiers!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based</h2>Gameplay unfolds in <strong>turns</strong>. Each turn, you'll make strategic decisions to build and <strong>upgrade</strong> your outpost, manage resources, and defend against enemy attacks. Plan your moves carefully to ensure your survival and success on the new planet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/f00c26ba6c5ac1946204273e61140113.poster.avif?t=1733414441\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/f00c26ba6c5ac1946204273e61140113.webm?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/f00c26ba6c5ac1946204273e61140113.mp4?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your outpost</h2>As you gather resources, you'll encounter periodic waves of <strong>enemies</strong> seeking to challenge your claim to the planet. <strong>Defend</strong> your outpost by strategically deploying defenses. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/ba09ab2c864e24a70306c4d0243201bf.poster.avif?t=1733414441\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/ba09ab2c864e24a70306c4d0243201bf.webm?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/ba09ab2c864e24a70306c4d0243201bf.mp4?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Journey to the stars</h2><strong>The ultimate goal</strong>: constructing your interstellar <strong>spacecraft</strong>. Once your vessel is complete and you've amassed sufficient resources, it's time to embark on a journey to new frontiers, leaving behind the conquered planet to seek out new worlds ripe for exploration and colonization. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.poster.avif?t=1733414441\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.webm?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.mp4?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to chart your course through the cosmos, balance resource management with tactical combat, and lead humanity's expansion into the stars in Cosmic Outpost. Are you ready to claim your place among the stars?",
