2997580/extras/ba09ab2c864e24a70306c4d0243201bf.mp4?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Journey to the stars</h2><strong>The ultimate goal</strong>: constructing your interstellar <strong>spacecraft</strong>. Once your vessel is complete and you've amassed sufficient resources, it's time to embark on a journey to new frontiers, leaving behind the conquered planet to seek out new worlds ripe for exploration and colonization. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.poster.avif?t=1733414441\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.webm?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997580/extras/5aec800c2cd35efe81f84a2fdda4968d.mp4?t=1733414441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to chart your course through the cosmos, balance resource management with tactical combat, and lead humanity's expansion into the stars in Cosmic Outpost. Are you ready to claim your place among the stars?",
